WEBVTT

01:49.850 --> 01:54.940
[A Dream Within A Dream]

01:55.050 --> 01:57.940
[Episode 14]

02:00.590 --> 02:01.400
Father.

02:02.870 --> 02:04.000
How did you get this?

02:04.480 --> 02:05.610
What happened to your face?

02:05.610 --> 02:07.650
It's nothing, just a small scratch.

02:07.880 --> 02:09.940
Where did you get this note from?

02:12.190 --> 02:13.590
You recognize this?

02:15.030 --> 02:17.030
There's a secret rumor going around

02:17.130 --> 02:18.550
that this is

02:18.570 --> 02:20.540
a formula for weapon forging.

02:27.360 --> 02:30.210
This is actually a pun that means

02:31.150 --> 02:32.480
your "beauty"

02:32.520 --> 02:34.220
stole my "heart."

02:35.120 --> 02:36.130
Father,

02:36.160 --> 02:38.250
this is just a cheesy pickup line

02:38.310 --> 02:40.590
that has nothing to do
with weapon forging.

02:40.590 --> 02:41.710
You still haven't answered me—

02:41.710 --> 02:42.770
How did you

02:42.870 --> 02:43.960
get this note?

02:45.829 --> 02:46.790
Not important.

02:49.150 --> 02:50.840
Didn't you just mention

02:50.960 --> 02:51.760
pickup lines?

02:53.710 --> 02:55.280
If you can recognize them,

02:55.520 --> 02:58.430
it means you're of marriageable age.

03:00.360 --> 03:01.520
Black tea or green tea?

03:01.520 --> 03:03.180
Stop beating around the bush.

03:03.310 --> 03:04.400
What exactly

03:04.680 --> 03:06.810
do you want to discuss about marriage?

03:10.630 --> 03:12.030
Recently in the capital,

03:12.400 --> 03:14.680
rumors about you and the Seventh Prince

03:14.940 --> 03:16.550
have been spreading wildly.

03:20.710 --> 03:24.240
It hurts both you
and the Song family.

03:25.630 --> 03:26.980
That Chu Guihong

03:27.150 --> 03:28.950
is almost 30.

03:29.710 --> 03:31.230
And you, a young lady,

03:31.250 --> 03:32.800
are already 24,

03:33.000 --> 03:34.870
no longer a child.

03:37.310 --> 03:39.079
As your father, I think

03:40.190 --> 03:43.460
it's time to fulfill
your marriage agreement.

03:45.740 --> 03:47.800
I swear, everyone in this drama

03:47.800 --> 03:49.280
has nothing better to do

03:49.280 --> 03:51.079
than push romance plots.

03:55.400 --> 03:56.190
Father.

03:57.079 --> 03:58.470
Chu Guihong and I

03:58.470 --> 04:00.240
have only known each other for days,

04:00.240 --> 04:02.030
with zero connection.

04:02.030 --> 04:03.080
You've to

04:03.080 --> 04:05.430
nurture it gradually
by experiencing things

04:05.430 --> 04:07.240
together.

04:08.470 --> 04:10.190
I'm just worried that

04:12.000 --> 04:15.280
if the court ever becomes chaotic,

04:15.650 --> 04:17.920
there will be no one to protect you.

04:18.180 --> 04:19.640
My darling daughter—

04:20.040 --> 04:21.070
Enough already.

04:21.190 --> 04:22.830
Stop with the theatrics

04:22.830 --> 04:24.030
and tell me straight.

04:24.600 --> 04:26.070
Why are you suddenly

04:26.120 --> 04:27.870
insisting on the marriage?

04:31.930 --> 04:33.540
Yimeng, oh Yimeng.

04:35.120 --> 04:38.180
Rumors are spreading about you
and the Seventh Prince.

04:39.120 --> 04:40.870
If it were someone else,

04:40.890 --> 04:43.240
I might consider it.

04:44.000 --> 04:47.040
But he's no ordinary man's son.

04:48.040 --> 04:50.310
Someone who grew up

04:50.310 --> 04:52.240
struggling in the cold palace,

04:53.720 --> 04:56.800
he has developed such a heart of stone,

04:56.800 --> 04:58.510
the nature of a wolf.

04:59.190 --> 05:00.000
For him,

05:00.160 --> 05:02.480
self-preservation always comes first.

05:03.470 --> 05:05.560
All those sweet words
and tender affection

05:05.560 --> 05:07.060
that come with romance

05:07.390 --> 05:08.190
are merely

05:08.210 --> 05:10.820
manipulable pawns at his disposal.

05:11.390 --> 05:13.100
Treasured when needed

05:13.120 --> 05:15.170
and discarded like worn-out shoes.

05:16.800 --> 05:19.070
He approaches you strategically,

05:19.070 --> 05:20.330
plotting against you.

05:21.460 --> 05:23.270
I don't trust anyone

05:23.490 --> 05:25.120
because no one has ever trusted me,

05:25.120 --> 05:26.430
not even you!

05:27.600 --> 05:28.510
You should know

05:29.870 --> 05:30.830
that things are

05:30.830 --> 05:33.480
not what they appear to be on the surface.

05:33.500 --> 05:36.030
What people say isn't
necessarily the truth.

05:36.250 --> 05:37.060
If

05:38.200 --> 05:40.200
you truly want to understand me,

05:41.070 --> 05:42.480
don't use your eyes.

05:45.570 --> 05:46.480
Use this.

05:49.750 --> 05:52.460
I'm just worried that the longer we wait,

05:52.630 --> 05:55.090
the more likely
he'll take advantage of you.

05:57.800 --> 06:00.630
Of course I know
Nan Heng isn't a good person,

06:01.680 --> 06:04.000
but I can't sacrifice

06:04.190 --> 06:06.720
Chu Guihong's happiness
just to save myself.

06:06.870 --> 06:07.930
Alright, alright.

06:08.800 --> 06:09.870
I may be old

06:10.010 --> 06:11.920
and don't understand you youngsters,

06:11.920 --> 06:13.430
but I can't stand by and watch

06:13.430 --> 06:14.690
you jump into the fire.

06:15.270 --> 06:16.600
At the musical banquet,

06:16.630 --> 06:19.030
try to build a connection
with Chu Guihong.

06:19.190 --> 06:20.160
In the coming days,

06:20.160 --> 06:21.560
I'll personally go
to the prince's residence

06:21.560 --> 06:23.020
to discuss your marriage.

06:23.040 --> 06:24.070
It's settled.

06:25.420 --> 06:26.230
Father!

06:26.430 --> 06:27.720
I didn't say yes!

06:28.630 --> 06:29.630
It's not up to you.

06:31.240 --> 06:32.310
She's getting married?

06:32.310 --> 06:33.190
I'm sure!

06:33.190 --> 06:34.630
I saw it with my own eyes.

06:34.920 --> 06:37.680
After court, Mr. Song and Chu Guihong

06:37.680 --> 06:39.330
were all smiles.

06:39.480 --> 06:40.630
Today I give you gifts;

06:40.630 --> 06:42.020
tomorrow you return the favor.

06:42.020 --> 06:43.720
At one point, they even
addressed each other

06:43.720 --> 06:45.650
as father-in-law and son-in-law.

06:45.870 --> 06:47.510
The wedding must be soon.

06:48.920 --> 06:50.390
Song Yude must be hastening

06:50.390 --> 06:52.450
that old marriage arrangement again

06:52.830 --> 06:54.390
so he wouldn't have to

06:54.390 --> 06:55.680
join under my command.

06:56.870 --> 06:58.120
And that Song Yimeng,

06:58.920 --> 07:00.190
does she think she can escape me

07:00.190 --> 07:01.650
by relying on Chu Guihong?

07:01.980 --> 07:03.680
Song Yude is my father.

07:03.920 --> 07:06.100
Chu Guihong is my fiancé.

07:06.430 --> 07:07.490
Isn't that enough?

07:09.040 --> 07:11.120
Do you already have a plan?

07:22.710 --> 07:25.440
The musical banquet
is the perfect opportunity.

07:26.190 --> 07:28.270
I'll humiliate Chu Guihong

07:29.070 --> 07:31.240
in front of all the capital's elites.

07:32.560 --> 07:34.100
By then, let's see if

07:34.920 --> 07:37.510
Song Yimeng still has
any desire to marry him.

07:43.820 --> 07:46.270
[Musical Banquet]

07:51.530 --> 07:53.950
Why did the Seventh Prince
choose such a place?

07:53.950 --> 07:56.720
The southern district has always been home
to the lowest classes,

07:56.720 --> 07:59.230
way beneath our status.

08:00.240 --> 08:01.410
Waning River Crescent

08:01.410 --> 08:02.940
is renowned in the capital.

08:03.390 --> 08:05.040
Since we're here,
let's make the best of it.

08:05.040 --> 08:06.370
I think it's quite nice.

08:06.680 --> 08:09.070
Today is a big day
for the Seventh Prince

08:09.100 --> 08:11.120
and our Xuanjia Army.

08:11.120 --> 08:13.630
Today is a big day
for Waning River Crescent

08:13.630 --> 08:15.510
and us Nightwalkers too.

08:15.510 --> 08:18.210
In the past, we dominated the battlefield,

08:18.430 --> 08:20.920
guarding the borders
against powerful enemies.

08:20.920 --> 08:23.650
In the past, we stood united,
commanding respect

08:23.720 --> 08:25.600
throughout the martial world.

08:25.720 --> 08:27.630
Today, for His Highness,

08:27.800 --> 08:29.720
we must make this banquet a success

08:29.720 --> 08:32.110
and connect with renowned figures
from all over!

08:32.110 --> 08:32.909
Today, we must

08:33.120 --> 08:35.840
host this banquet well for our Chief,
and establish our dominance

08:35.840 --> 08:37.440
among the capital's guilds.

08:37.480 --> 08:40.120
For His Highness to connect
with renowned figures!

08:40.120 --> 08:42.669
For our Chief to dominate
the capital's guilds!

08:42.669 --> 08:45.530
For His Highness to connect
with renowned figures!

08:45.600 --> 08:48.260
For our Chief to dominate
the capital's guilds!

08:52.510 --> 08:55.200
Isn't this Mr. Shangguan
from Waning River Crescent?

08:55.200 --> 08:57.600
What a unique way of
managing your subordinates.

08:57.600 --> 08:59.120
I'm just working for the Chief Master,

08:59.120 --> 09:00.220
nothing worth mentioning.

09:00.220 --> 09:01.200
But I must say,

09:01.200 --> 09:03.120
Mr. Fugui, you're usually so subservient

09:03.120 --> 09:05.670
by Seventh Prince's side,
kneeling and kowtowing,

09:05.670 --> 09:07.870
but you're actually quite commanding

09:07.910 --> 09:09.510
in front of the Xuanjia Army.

09:10.270 --> 09:13.080
It seems you've been paying
close attention to me.

09:13.200 --> 09:14.510
Have we met before?

09:14.610 --> 09:15.870
Don't be mistaken.

09:15.870 --> 09:18.410
Unattractive things
don't leave an impression on me.

09:18.410 --> 09:19.600
Well, well.

09:19.490 --> 09:26.640
[Graceful and Composed]

09:19.840 --> 09:23.200
Through changing seasons,
His Highness maintains his grand spirit.

09:23.200 --> 09:27.200
As empires rise and fall, only
His Highness's vision remains constant.

09:27.290 --> 09:29.000
-Yes.
-Indeed.

09:29.000 --> 09:32.710
Talents gather from all corners,

09:33.000 --> 09:35.860
embracing the world's brilliant minds.

09:36.120 --> 09:38.480
Throughout history,
great generals and talents have emerged,

09:38.480 --> 09:41.750
but none compare to
His Highness's unmatched elegance.

09:42.360 --> 09:43.960
-Bootlicker.
-Bootlicker.

09:47.120 --> 09:47.870
Cousin.

09:49.630 --> 09:50.440
Cousin!

09:51.670 --> 09:52.930
What's wrong with you?

09:53.510 --> 09:54.910
Please don't call me Cousin.

09:54.910 --> 09:56.710
I don't deserve it, truly don't.

09:57.000 --> 09:58.440
I was confined for 20 days,

09:58.440 --> 10:00.080
but you didn't come visit me once.

10:00.080 --> 10:01.510
Am I still your family?

10:05.790 --> 10:06.650
Your Highness.

10:06.870 --> 10:08.440
I was busy renovating the south
with Yimeng

10:08.440 --> 10:09.600
during those days.

10:09.600 --> 10:11.200
I understand. I get it.

10:11.670 --> 10:12.870
Gals before pals.

10:13.880 --> 10:15.170
I wonder who it was

10:15.200 --> 10:17.440
who accompanied you
to make trouble all his life,

10:17.440 --> 10:19.270
who helped you fight battles,

10:19.270 --> 10:19.840
and who...

10:19.840 --> 10:20.970
You've got it wrong.

10:22.200 --> 10:24.200
That's what General Chu did for you.

10:25.270 --> 10:26.120
Is that so?

10:27.030 --> 10:27.840
Chu Guihong!

10:29.030 --> 10:29.840
Yimeng!

10:30.630 --> 10:32.430
Your Highness, I was wrong about that.

10:32.430 --> 10:33.630
I'm really sorry.

10:35.360 --> 10:36.150
No need.

10:36.390 --> 10:37.080
Listen,

10:37.080 --> 10:39.080
principle matters the most as a prince.

10:39.080 --> 10:40.500
We wouldn't need the capital prefect

10:40.500 --> 10:41.960
if apologies were useful!

10:45.080 --> 10:45.870
Also,

10:45.870 --> 10:47.000
I'm a mature adult

10:47.000 --> 10:49.130
who's had my coming-of-age ceremony.

10:49.790 --> 10:50.910
I'll never get upset

10:50.910 --> 10:52.550
because you care more about women

10:52.550 --> 10:53.720
than me.

10:53.840 --> 10:55.320
It'd be so childish.

10:55.320 --> 10:57.980
Extremely, thoroughly,
and utterly childish!

10:59.030 --> 11:00.550
Like a three-year-old kid.

11:00.550 --> 11:01.200
Watch your words.

11:01.200 --> 11:02.840
Who are you calling a three-year-old?

11:02.840 --> 11:04.570
How can you insult me like this?

11:04.720 --> 11:06.200
Also, you and Father

11:06.200 --> 11:06.910
both treat me

11:06.910 --> 11:08.510
like a child who never grows up,

11:08.510 --> 11:09.910
never consulting me on anything,

11:09.910 --> 11:12.080
yet now suddenly expect me
to mature overnight.

11:12.080 --> 11:13.600
You get to make all the arguments,

11:13.600 --> 11:14.720
while all the faults are mine.

11:14.720 --> 11:16.000
Is that fair? Is it?

11:18.510 --> 11:19.370
Your Highness,

11:19.670 --> 11:21.080
if you're truly upset,

11:21.080 --> 11:22.480
let's find a private place

11:22.480 --> 11:23.810
to clear everything up.

11:23.870 --> 11:26.030
This will only make us a laughingstock.

11:26.030 --> 11:26.860
What are you doing?

11:26.860 --> 11:27.790
Mind your behavior!

11:27.790 --> 11:29.240
Don't pull at me like that!

11:29.240 --> 11:31.240
What would others think if they saw us?

11:31.240 --> 11:32.240
Wait, I'm stepping on my robe.

11:32.240 --> 11:33.910
I never noticed before

11:34.390 --> 11:36.520
that those two are quite interesting.

11:37.550 --> 11:38.520
But weren't you

11:39.030 --> 11:39.750
planning to

11:39.750 --> 11:41.950
clear things up with General Chu today?

11:42.960 --> 11:44.510
The Eighteenth Prince was right—

11:44.510 --> 11:46.440
You're the one he cares about most.

11:46.580 --> 11:48.530
If he finds out you like Mr. Li,

11:49.270 --> 11:50.720
won't he be heartbroken?

11:53.080 --> 11:54.480
What can I do about it?

11:55.750 --> 11:57.370
Feelings

11:57.510 --> 11:59.000
can't be faked.

11:59.390 --> 12:00.840
Better to come clean soon

12:00.910 --> 12:02.510
so I don't waste his time.

12:05.510 --> 12:06.840
Is everything in place?

12:06.960 --> 12:07.890
Don't worry.

12:07.990 --> 12:09.710
Everything is under control.

12:10.240 --> 12:11.390
Chu Guihong will definitely

12:11.390 --> 12:13.790
make a fool of himself
in front of Miss Song.

12:22.910 --> 12:23.720
Come here.

12:29.870 --> 12:31.170
Not you.

12:36.720 --> 12:37.630
Come here!

12:40.390 --> 12:41.280
Sorry,

12:41.510 --> 12:43.320
but being popular with women

12:43.620 --> 12:45.150
has nothing to do with rank.

12:50.600 --> 12:51.390
Miss Song.

12:52.030 --> 12:52.840
Come here!

12:52.860 --> 12:55.210
Why are you hanging out with Nan Heng?

12:55.270 --> 12:56.720
Don't you know how cunning

12:56.720 --> 12:57.480
he is?

12:57.480 --> 12:58.880
You'd better be careful.

13:01.320 --> 13:02.120
Okay.

13:03.520 --> 13:05.120
I don't see Mr. Li anywhere.

13:05.120 --> 13:06.080
Where is he?

13:07.030 --> 13:08.390
The Chief is on a mission.

13:08.390 --> 13:09.320
If you have a message,

13:09.320 --> 13:10.920
I'd be happy to pass it along.

13:13.000 --> 13:14.790
Well, maybe this is better.

13:15.000 --> 13:16.510
If Chu Guihong found out,

13:16.510 --> 13:18.380
who knows what might happen.

13:20.120 --> 13:21.580
I'll show you to your seat.

13:28.080 --> 13:29.270
Yiting, here,

13:29.440 --> 13:30.640
try these two dishes.

13:30.670 --> 13:35.040
[Big Fortune]

13:31.080 --> 13:32.080
If you want more, let me know.

13:32.080 --> 13:33.000
I'll get you more.

13:33.000 --> 13:34.630
The deer calls.

13:35.270 --> 13:35.910
All tables are full.

13:35.910 --> 13:36.550
Yimeng.

13:36.600 --> 13:37.270
There's one there.

13:37.270 --> 13:37.840
Sit here!

13:37.840 --> 13:38.600
Sit there.

13:40.200 --> 13:40.870
Come.

13:42.220 --> 13:43.420
The food here's good.

13:47.830 --> 13:49.540
Why are you everywhere I go?

13:51.670 --> 13:53.870
Didn't you know that I'm the host

13:53.900 --> 13:55.040
of this banquet?

14:06.120 --> 14:07.770
What were you talking about

14:08.270 --> 14:09.330
with Shangguan He?

14:09.910 --> 14:11.700
Is that any of your business?

14:15.200 --> 14:16.000
What,

14:16.960 --> 14:18.150
do you have a cold?

14:24.790 --> 14:26.450
I'm just concerned about you.

14:26.630 --> 14:28.120
Is the food to your liking?

14:28.910 --> 14:31.080
If there's anything you'd like to eat,
just say so.

14:31.080 --> 14:32.740
Don't hold back like last time

14:33.030 --> 14:34.000
in my mansion.

14:35.910 --> 14:37.270
When was I ever in your mansion?

14:37.270 --> 14:38.030
Song Yimeng.

14:38.470 --> 14:40.970
So it's true that you dined
at Seventh Prince's

14:40.970 --> 14:42.130
mansion?

14:42.670 --> 14:44.330
Enough, don't pry.

14:44.480 --> 14:45.720
She's quite shy.

14:46.030 --> 14:47.320
Don't embarrass her.

14:48.870 --> 14:50.070
What are you on about?

14:51.240 --> 14:52.790
This must be from Chapter 16,

14:52.790 --> 14:54.510
when the Seventh Prince
pours his heart out over wine

14:52.910 --> 14:53.900
[Exceptional Love]

14:54.510 --> 14:56.770
after the beautiful maiden
sneaks into his mansion.

14:56.160 --> 14:59.150
[Exceptional Love]

14:56.800 --> 14:57.720
Are you sure?

14:57.720 --> 14:59.240
It sounds more like the part where

14:59.240 --> 15:00.790
the young general forces marriage

15:00.790 --> 15:02.820
and breaks up the true lovers.

15:03.240 --> 15:04.720
W-What's going on?

15:05.120 --> 15:06.250
Everyone has a copy?

15:06.910 --> 15:08.390
So you've all read it?

15:08.450 --> 15:09.760
[Exceptional Love]

15:10.360 --> 15:12.580
Who's read it?
Don't slander me!

15:13.000 --> 15:15.400
I know nothing about any "Illusory Dream."

15:17.180 --> 15:18.120
Yimeng,

15:18.270 --> 15:19.630
the Songs' reputation is at stake.

15:19.630 --> 15:21.360
Don't you have anything to say?

15:21.750 --> 15:22.510
Of course I do—

15:22.510 --> 15:24.070
Rumors end with the wise.

15:24.090 --> 15:25.570
No need for explanations.

15:25.590 --> 15:27.480
Of course you don't need to explain.

15:27.480 --> 15:29.540
You're clearly scheming against me.

15:30.920 --> 15:32.900
Fine, whatever you say.

15:37.030 --> 15:38.630
Seventh Prince, I disagree.

15:42.790 --> 15:45.410
A rumor must be clarified.

15:45.510 --> 15:46.970
Yimeng is my fiancée.

15:47.270 --> 15:48.630
Regarding this novel,

15:48.630 --> 15:50.290
I've been wanting to explain.

15:50.440 --> 15:51.790
Since everyone is here,

15:52.270 --> 15:55.120
I request Your Highness
to clarify this in person.

15:57.660 --> 16:00.120
Neither of the involved parties
has spoken.

16:00.670 --> 16:02.930
You're just an outsider. Why so anxious?

16:03.330 --> 16:06.250
General Chu, aren't you
a bit too insecure?

16:06.270 --> 16:07.190
Your Highness.

16:09.690 --> 16:11.510
Yimeng and I've been engaged
since childhood.

16:11.510 --> 16:13.120
You've repeatedly harassed her.

16:13.120 --> 16:14.520
What exactly do you want?

16:14.720 --> 16:15.840
What do I want?

16:16.600 --> 16:17.720
Isn't it clear?

16:17.740 --> 16:18.480
You—

16:18.480 --> 16:19.200
Enough!

16:19.840 --> 16:21.320
Will you two ever stop?

16:22.480 --> 16:24.600
Fine, I'll take this opportunity

16:24.720 --> 16:26.600
to make things clear today.

16:27.790 --> 16:29.570
You and you!

16:29.670 --> 16:31.670
I'm not interested in either of you.

16:32.080 --> 16:34.270
What "Illusory Dream"
and "Exceptional Love"?

16:34.270 --> 16:35.750
Utter nonsense!

16:35.910 --> 16:36.670
From now on,

16:36.670 --> 16:39.030
if anyone gossips behind my back again,

16:39.080 --> 16:40.510
I won't be so polite.

16:43.270 --> 16:44.270
Alright, stop staring.

16:44.270 --> 16:45.600
Just eat your food!

16:50.270 --> 16:51.320
Your Majesty.

16:51.910 --> 16:53.120
I've learned that

16:53.150 --> 16:58.680
[Exceptional Love]

16:53.480 --> 16:55.670
this woman knows the Seventh Prince
and General Chu

16:55.670 --> 16:56.630
have always been at odds,

16:56.630 --> 16:58.840
yet she continues to get involved
with the Seventh Prince.

16:58.840 --> 17:01.360
She's calculating and cannot be tolerated.

17:02.270 --> 17:04.480
Your Majesty, I suggest issuing

17:04.910 --> 17:06.480
an imperial decree right now

17:06.480 --> 17:08.920
to severely punish her.

17:09.680 --> 17:12.490
[Exceptional Love]

17:11.369 --> 17:16.510
♪ Who drinks in the wind
as snow turns to ash? ♪

17:16.510 --> 17:17.920
How moving!

17:18.069 --> 17:19.329
Ladies and gentlemen,

17:19.440 --> 17:22.000
this is the first year
Waning River Crescent

17:22.000 --> 17:23.720
has hosted this banquet.

17:23.790 --> 17:26.609
[Big Fortune]

17:23.920 --> 17:26.720
I've been instructed to spice things up

17:26.720 --> 17:29.790
for all our distinguished guests.

17:31.550 --> 17:33.640
Legend has it that
the ancient kingdom of Rulan,

17:33.640 --> 17:34.790
standing in the desert,

17:34.790 --> 17:38.070
nurtured a Seven-Jewel Snow Lotus
within a mirage.

17:38.510 --> 17:41.640
Later, skilled craftsmen
adorned it with fine gold.

17:41.640 --> 17:43.970
Another iconic scene from period dramas:

17:44.270 --> 17:46.590
people fighting over some treasure,

17:46.720 --> 17:47.880
trying to trip each other up.

17:47.880 --> 17:51.720
This hairpin shall be given
to a person of talent.

17:51.920 --> 17:53.220
Bravo! Bravo!

17:53.240 --> 17:55.590
Bravo! Bravo!

18:00.480 --> 18:01.340
I've heard that

18:01.720 --> 18:03.880
whenever the Qianyu Army
returns victorious,

18:03.880 --> 18:05.400
they play their military anthem

18:05.400 --> 18:07.640
to showcase their might to the world.

18:08.070 --> 18:09.450
Unfortunately,

18:09.640 --> 18:11.790
General Chu has suffered
consecutive defeats in recent years,

18:11.790 --> 18:13.920
and we haven't heard
that anthem for a while.

18:13.920 --> 18:16.130
I wonder if General Chu is in the mood

18:16.200 --> 18:18.680
to bless us with the magnificent tune?

18:18.720 --> 18:19.510
Heng.

18:20.510 --> 18:21.680
Don't go too far!

18:21.720 --> 18:22.640
As a prince of Great Jing,

18:22.640 --> 18:23.920
is the defeat of Qianyu Army

18:23.920 --> 18:25.320
something to be proud of?

18:25.720 --> 18:27.180
At the Battle of Pingrong,

18:27.350 --> 18:28.830
General Chu was defeated

18:29.070 --> 18:30.510
and fled in panic.

18:30.510 --> 18:33.560
If not for the Seventh Prince's
clever strategy

18:33.680 --> 18:34.720
to rescue General Chu

18:34.720 --> 18:37.350
from the Heyuan prisoner's cage,

18:37.400 --> 18:39.270
the so-called war god of Great Jing

18:39.270 --> 18:42.400
would now be nothing
but bones on the northern frontier.

18:42.400 --> 18:43.450
Shut up!

18:43.640 --> 18:45.350
Y-You're just a demoted official.

18:45.350 --> 18:46.510
What do you know?

18:46.510 --> 18:48.270
If you're so capable,
go fight them in Heyuan yourself!

18:48.270 --> 18:49.030
Go on!

18:49.640 --> 18:50.720
Eighteenth Prince,

18:50.720 --> 18:52.480
you must be joking.

18:52.510 --> 18:54.160
I am but a civil official.

18:54.160 --> 18:57.030
Officials advise with words,
soldiers fight with weapons.

18:57.030 --> 18:59.440
Don't you know this principle,
Your Highness?

18:59.440 --> 19:01.070
What nonsense are you talking about?

19:01.070 --> 19:02.590
After General Chu's defeat,

19:02.590 --> 19:04.520
not only did he escape punishment,

19:04.720 --> 19:06.680
but His Majesty favored him even more,

19:06.680 --> 19:08.070
promoting him twice.

19:08.640 --> 19:10.920
Naturally, many in court and beyond
are displeased.

19:10.920 --> 19:11.680
Therefore,

19:11.920 --> 19:13.920
I'm hosting this musical gathering

19:14.200 --> 19:17.480
to help restore General Chu's morale.

19:17.840 --> 19:20.770
Rui, I mean well.

19:20.830 --> 19:22.060
You just...

19:24.070 --> 19:25.530
For this musical banquet,

19:25.930 --> 19:28.930
the Seventh Prince is the host,
and I'm merely a guest.

19:29.310 --> 19:30.310
A guest shouldn't

19:30.570 --> 19:32.130
steal the host's thunder.

19:33.130 --> 19:34.880
Guihong is right.

19:35.170 --> 19:37.540
Heng, as the host,

19:37.680 --> 19:41.030
you should perform the opening piece.

19:43.220 --> 19:43.980
Very well.

19:47.360 --> 19:49.490
Look at that sinister look on his face.

19:49.520 --> 19:50.850
I bet he is up to no good.

19:50.960 --> 19:51.750
Everyone,

19:52.220 --> 19:54.360
the opening piece for today's banquet

19:54.440 --> 19:56.240
is really significant.

19:56.790 --> 19:58.130
It's called

19:58.310 --> 19:59.440
"Pingrong Battle:

19:59.920 --> 20:01.750
Guihong Scouts the Camp."

20:39.070 --> 20:39.880
Fu...

20:43.880 --> 20:44.680
Guihong,

20:45.010 --> 20:47.050
isn't that Fugui?

20:47.480 --> 20:49.720
Look at his crazy getup.
Who is he supposed to be?

20:49.720 --> 20:50.850
Eighteenth Prince,

20:51.000 --> 20:53.790
Fugui is portraying the person beside you,

20:53.830 --> 20:56.680
the brave and mighty General Chu.

20:59.030 --> 20:59.830
Guihong,

21:00.510 --> 21:02.310
why is Fugui dressed up like you?

21:05.030 --> 21:07.070
Why did you make Fugui dress up

21:07.070 --> 21:08.110
like Chu Guihong?

21:08.110 --> 21:10.840
Aren't you deliberately
mocking Jing's war god?

21:11.160 --> 21:12.750
I know nothing about this.

21:13.590 --> 21:14.750
As if!

21:16.470 --> 21:18.030
What's going on?

21:27.680 --> 21:30.310
Attack!

21:47.370 --> 21:49.410
[Big Fortune]

21:47.720 --> 21:50.790
This depicts General Chu
scouting the enemy camp at night.

21:50.790 --> 21:53.770
Now the Heyuan forces are
surrounding the Qianyu Army.

21:53.770 --> 21:55.190
He's been captured.

21:55.350 --> 21:56.640
What a failure.

22:01.400 --> 22:03.270
Pingrong Battle: Guihong Scouts the Camp.

22:03.270 --> 22:06.070
It's Nan Heng at the banquet
who's the real troublemaker, isn't it?

22:06.070 --> 22:08.480
Are you really a prince of Great Jing?

22:09.240 --> 22:10.720
A noble prince of Great Jing

22:10.720 --> 22:12.110
actually let his subordinates

22:12.110 --> 22:13.640
humiliate the Qianyu Army.

22:13.680 --> 22:15.120
Have you no shame?

22:20.920 --> 22:22.050
Where are you going?

22:22.310 --> 22:23.280
To beat the drum.

22:23.430 --> 22:24.440
You know how to?

22:24.680 --> 22:26.880
Sorry, just about two years' practice.

22:34.350 --> 22:35.330
Seventh Prince.

22:38.550 --> 22:40.080
What's going on with Fugui?

22:40.270 --> 22:41.510
Fugui volunteered

22:41.510 --> 22:42.960
to perform this scene.

22:42.960 --> 22:44.240
I couldn't stop him.

22:46.510 --> 22:48.650
I only want Chu Guihong humiliated,

22:48.740 --> 22:50.630
not the Qianyu Army.

22:54.310 --> 22:56.150
As the war drum sounds,

22:56.310 --> 22:58.600
thousands of troops follow my command!

23:03.310 --> 23:04.070
This...

23:04.090 --> 23:05.580
Yimeng is helping me.

23:13.540 --> 23:15.190
The drumbeat is all wrong.

23:15.210 --> 23:16.810
How can we perform like this?

23:18.050 --> 23:21.410
Enemies approach, war drums thunder!

23:27.960 --> 23:29.780
You're all Great Jing's finest men.

23:29.780 --> 23:31.160
Fight back!

23:46.590 --> 23:48.600
What the hell is she doing?

23:49.110 --> 23:50.400
Ridiculous.

23:50.440 --> 23:50.960
Come down!

23:50.960 --> 23:51.910
Yeah!

23:52.240 --> 23:53.900
Stop embarrassing yourself.

23:53.920 --> 23:54.510
Boo!

23:54.510 --> 23:55.270
Come down!

24:02.200 --> 24:04.310
Stop making a fool of yourself!

24:04.310 --> 24:05.680
So unladylike!

24:05.680 --> 24:07.510
Just go home
and do some needlework instead!

24:07.510 --> 24:08.310
-Exactly!
-Yeah!

24:08.310 --> 24:09.270
Go home!

24:10.590 --> 24:11.680
Are you deaf?

24:11.680 --> 24:13.310
-So embarrassing!
-Boo!

24:13.790 --> 24:14.640
Just go back.

24:14.830 --> 24:15.640
Boo!

24:15.660 --> 24:17.390
Someone's getting impatient.

24:30.270 --> 24:31.240
Nan Heng?

24:31.510 --> 24:32.510
Don't talk.

25:12.750 --> 25:14.640
It's the Xuanjia Army's rallying drums.

25:14.640 --> 25:16.400
Attack!

25:15.410 --> 25:18.710
♪ Where are the enemies at the gate?
Let the wind howl ♪

25:17.920 --> 25:19.920
Attack!

25:19.830 --> 25:21.900
♪ We once battled with fate ♪

25:24.040 --> 25:27.140
♪ Unruly and arrogant ♪

25:27.780 --> 25:29.960
♪ Trampled yet laughs it off ♪

25:31.880 --> 25:35.170
♪ As a lone wolf,
forget who I'm proud of ♪

25:36.070 --> 25:38.250
I've seen all the people's hearts

25:39.750 --> 25:42.930
♪ In this world full of challenges,
I wield my blade ♪

25:43.950 --> 25:46.170
♪ Take care of tomorrow ♪

25:47.940 --> 25:50.020
♪ A lamp as bright as the stars ♪

25:51.820 --> 25:53.860
A drop of rain gives birth to roots

25:55.960 --> 26:01.630
♪ Experiencing the ups and downs of life
beats reading thousands of books ♪

26:03.260 --> 26:07.080
♪ I'm willing to go with the wind ♪

26:08.020 --> 26:10.720
♪ Pure of heart,
roaming free across the lands ♪

26:11.800 --> 26:14.720
♪ No waiting, no hate,
I write my own story ♪

26:15.810 --> 26:18.400
♪ I give my all for what I believe in ♪

26:19.170 --> 26:23.050
♪ I'm willing to go with the wind ♪

26:23.750 --> 26:26.860
♪ And run into the fog with no regrets ♪

26:27.670 --> 26:30.720
♪ Even if rain pours on the path ahead ♪

26:31.670 --> 26:34.170
♪ For this life, for all beings ♪

26:35.060 --> 26:37.230
♪ Sweeping through a thousand years
of dust ♪

26:40.750 --> 26:41.960
Bravo!

26:42.310 --> 26:44.940
Bravo! Bravo!

26:44.970 --> 26:48.680
Bravo! Bravo!

26:48.680 --> 26:49.310
That was amazing!

26:49.310 --> 26:51.240
Wonderful!

26:51.240 --> 26:52.400
So inspiring!

26:52.830 --> 26:53.960
Truly spectacular!

26:54.160 --> 26:56.230
Bravo! Bravo!

26:56.250 --> 26:58.240
Bravo! Bravo!

26:58.270 --> 27:00.510
Bravo! Bravo!

27:00.510 --> 27:02.440
Wasn't I supposed to
humiliate Chu Guihong?

27:02.440 --> 27:03.840
How did he end up winning?

27:05.790 --> 27:07.070
I was practically possessed

27:07.070 --> 27:08.670
by His Highness's drumming.

27:14.590 --> 27:15.400
Guihong,

27:16.000 --> 27:17.000
why do I feel like

27:17.160 --> 27:18.960
Heng was actually helping you?

27:19.960 --> 27:21.090
He wasn't helping me

27:21.610 --> 27:22.720
but Yimeng.

27:28.720 --> 27:29.750
Don't think I don't know

27:29.750 --> 27:31.110
why you helped me.

27:31.590 --> 27:32.590
Let me tell you,

27:32.680 --> 27:34.740
no matter how many rumors you create,

27:34.750 --> 27:35.640
you and I

27:36.200 --> 27:37.260
will never happen.

27:39.240 --> 27:40.640
You're overthinking it.

27:40.680 --> 27:41.910
I was only helping you

27:42.070 --> 27:44.400
because of those rules you mentioned.

27:44.960 --> 27:46.080
Rules?

27:46.240 --> 27:48.970
Like saving the damsel in distress?

27:49.070 --> 27:49.750
Why did

27:49.750 --> 27:51.030
His Highness help Chu Guihong

27:51.030 --> 27:52.380
and Song Yimeng?

27:52.510 --> 27:54.070
Could he be infatuated

27:54.070 --> 27:55.070
and lost his mind?

27:55.100 --> 27:56.900
I think you're the confused one.

27:57.340 --> 27:59.030
What was the point of this performance?

27:59.030 --> 28:00.030
To humiliate Chu Guihong.

28:00.030 --> 28:01.440
And who is Song Yimeng to Chu Guihong?

28:01.440 --> 28:02.310
His bride-to-be.

28:02.310 --> 28:03.640
And who is the Seventh Prince
to Chu Guihong?

28:03.640 --> 28:04.640
A bitter romantic rival.

28:04.640 --> 28:05.830
Isn't it clear now?

28:05.830 --> 28:07.960
What's clear? Don't leave me hanging.

28:08.510 --> 28:09.880
The performance we put on

28:09.880 --> 28:10.960
had two acts:

28:10.960 --> 28:13.270
"Pingrong Battle: Guihong Scouts the Camp"

28:13.270 --> 28:14.310
and

28:14.350 --> 28:17.910
"Musical Banquet:
Nan Heng Seizes His Love."

28:19.510 --> 28:20.310
I get it now.

28:20.450 --> 28:23.160
His Highness not only
turned defeat into victory

28:23.160 --> 28:25.910
but also won Miss Song's favor.

28:26.920 --> 28:29.810
What a brilliant move!

28:30.920 --> 28:31.920
I need to go

28:31.920 --> 28:33.590
add fuel to this fire.

28:39.880 --> 28:41.680
Those two had so much chemistry.

28:41.680 --> 28:43.070
They must be more than friends.

28:42.910 --> 28:46.570
[Natural Talent]

28:43.270 --> 28:45.400
And they call it rumors?
Who are they fooling?

28:45.400 --> 28:46.800
Creating beautiful music together,

28:46.800 --> 28:47.830
"Illusory Dream"

28:47.830 --> 28:49.560
must be entering a new chapter.

28:50.310 --> 28:52.570
The Seventh Prince and Miss Song
drummed together,

28:52.220 --> 28:55.260
[Big Fortune]

28:52.650 --> 28:55.380
the lingering sound
truly deserved first place.

28:56.160 --> 28:58.510
It's just a pity there's only one hairpin,

28:58.590 --> 29:00.650
difficult for the two of you to share.

29:02.200 --> 29:03.270
Just give it to her.

29:04.000 --> 29:04.960
To be honest,

29:05.200 --> 29:07.790
I have also read "Exceptional Love."

29:08.030 --> 29:10.720
Your deep bond moves everyone to tears.

29:11.310 --> 29:13.640
This chance doesn't come easy.

29:13.960 --> 29:15.110
Seventh Prince,

29:15.110 --> 29:17.440
why don't you personally
pin it on Miss Song

29:17.440 --> 29:18.640
to satisfy

29:19.160 --> 29:20.550
everyone's wishes?

29:20.920 --> 29:21.680
Nice!

29:21.680 --> 29:23.500
Sounds good!

29:23.530 --> 29:25.490
Totally!

29:25.520 --> 29:27.070
Sounds good!

29:30.880 --> 29:32.240
I doubt it's necessary.

29:32.720 --> 29:33.400
Why don't you...

29:33.400 --> 29:34.160
Song Yimeng.

29:34.880 --> 29:36.510
I just helped you out.

29:37.270 --> 29:38.070
So what?

29:38.780 --> 29:41.220
So don't spoil everyone's fun.

29:50.680 --> 29:52.580
The music competition isn't over yet.

29:52.580 --> 29:53.930
Isn't this prize

29:53.950 --> 29:55.480
awarded a bit prematurely?

29:58.860 --> 30:00.170
Chu Guihong,

30:00.830 --> 30:02.030
if I remember correctly,

30:02.030 --> 30:04.510
Miss Song just helped you out
of a difficult situation.

30:04.510 --> 30:06.030
It's one thing if others object,

30:06.030 --> 30:07.590
but you?

30:08.090 --> 30:11.420
Or have you changed your mind

30:11.500 --> 30:14.390
and want to play
the Qianyu Army's victory song?

30:16.880 --> 30:19.010
The Qianyu Army's anthem
is not to be disrespected.

30:19.010 --> 30:20.640
However, I do have a piece

30:20.880 --> 30:22.470
that I can perform.

30:22.720 --> 30:23.880
It's also called

30:24.750 --> 30:26.190
"Pingrong Battle:

30:26.310 --> 30:28.240
Guihong Scouts the Camp."

31:00.380 --> 31:01.720
Fight in Pingrong.

31:02.160 --> 31:05.320
Countless enemy troops surround the city!

31:11.110 --> 31:11.880
General!

31:11.730 --> 31:14.070
[Thunderous Sonic Boom]

31:11.880 --> 31:13.090
Please save us, General!

31:13.090 --> 31:15.900
Please, save us!

31:16.030 --> 31:18.240
-Please help us!
-Have mercy!

31:27.920 --> 31:29.570
Seeking aid,

31:29.830 --> 31:32.920
carrier pigeons are sent
beyond the Northern Pass.

31:45.510 --> 31:46.780
Heartless betrayal,

31:46.920 --> 31:49.780
the scoundrels of Youcheng
refused to send troops.

32:14.710 --> 32:16.610
Nothing but sorrow,

32:17.480 --> 32:22.350
soldiers perished,
their heroic spirits extinguished!

32:27.120 --> 32:29.800
[Heyuan's enemy camp]

32:56.320 --> 32:56.970
Bravo!

32:57.270 --> 32:58.020
Excellent!

32:59.030 --> 33:01.880
Wonderful!

33:02.550 --> 33:03.510
Amazing!

33:03.510 --> 33:04.960
Brilliant!

33:04.960 --> 33:06.020
Impressive moves!

33:08.550 --> 33:09.350
Guihong!

33:12.920 --> 33:14.480
Guihong, what a surprise.

33:16.440 --> 33:17.300
Your Highness.

33:17.550 --> 33:19.070
From what Chu Guihong implied,

33:19.070 --> 33:21.050
during Pingrong Battle
when Heyuan forces surrounded the city,

33:21.050 --> 33:23.480
the Qianyu Army sent carrier pigeons
asking for our help.

33:23.480 --> 33:24.480
But we never received

33:24.480 --> 33:25.680
any of their pigeons.

33:26.350 --> 33:28.000
Should I go explain it to him?

33:29.300 --> 33:31.050
Would he believe you?

33:31.790 --> 33:32.590
You're right.

33:33.070 --> 33:35.200
Your reputation outside is terrible.

33:35.300 --> 33:37.170
No, no, no, what I meant was...

33:37.200 --> 33:37.890
um...

33:41.500 --> 33:43.510
The "Pingrong Battle:
Guihong Scouts the Camp" novel.

33:41.580 --> 33:42.470
[Pingrong Battle: Guihong Scouts the Camp]

33:43.640 --> 33:44.510
Here you go.

33:44.510 --> 33:45.440
Before long,

33:45.440 --> 33:47.530
this story will spread
throughout Great Jing.

33:47.530 --> 33:49.550
By then, he'll be completely disgraced

33:49.550 --> 33:51.350
and have no place in the capital.

33:51.400 --> 33:52.030
Tear it up.

33:54.160 --> 33:55.020
Your Highness,

33:55.400 --> 33:56.680
not going after Chu Guihong anymore?

33:56.680 --> 33:57.940
I told you to tear it up!

33:58.680 --> 33:59.510
Sure, sure.

34:00.110 --> 34:00.880
Right away.

34:08.590 --> 34:09.280
It's torn.

34:12.670 --> 34:13.480
Also...

34:16.320 --> 34:18.920
Look into the matter
of those carrier pigeons.

34:22.639 --> 34:24.370
Chu Guihong's performance

34:24.679 --> 34:26.500
was truly beyond impressive.

34:26.630 --> 34:27.400
Totally!

34:27.400 --> 34:28.280
Yeah!

34:28.320 --> 34:29.670
-Exactly!
-I agree!

34:29.670 --> 34:30.190
The best!

34:30.190 --> 34:31.030
So, Nan Heng,

34:31.639 --> 34:32.969
you should

34:33.320 --> 34:34.719
give up your first place.

34:35.550 --> 34:36.810
Why should I give it up?

34:37.030 --> 34:37.960
Seventh Prince,

34:38.510 --> 34:39.710
the musical banquet

34:39.840 --> 34:41.570
is filled with decadent music.

34:41.630 --> 34:43.320
Being immersed in it for too long

34:43.320 --> 34:45.760
makes one forget the hardships
of people at the border

34:45.760 --> 34:48.889
and the difficulties soldiers face
defending our land.

34:48.889 --> 34:51.000
Today's performances of
singing and sword dancing

34:51.000 --> 34:52.800
fully display Great Jing's might,

34:52.800 --> 34:54.120
upholding our national prestige.

34:54.120 --> 34:55.330
Truly admirable.

34:55.800 --> 34:56.400
Yes,

34:56.420 --> 34:57.020
indeed.

34:57.050 --> 34:59.680
I didn't expect Yiting to be so eloquent.

35:09.190 --> 35:10.110
Your Highness,

35:12.190 --> 35:13.030
I concede.

35:44.320 --> 35:45.070
Yimeng.

35:45.850 --> 35:47.310
I was at the border before,

35:47.590 --> 35:49.120
which delayed us for years.

35:49.800 --> 35:51.320
Now I've returned to the capital

35:51.320 --> 35:52.650
and rejoined the court.

35:53.400 --> 35:55.510
Our engagement's been postponed
for too long.

35:55.510 --> 35:56.550
I've let you down.

35:57.960 --> 35:58.760
Today,

35:59.280 --> 36:01.190
in front of everyone present...

36:01.190 --> 36:02.590
Chu Guihong, please.

36:02.590 --> 36:04.000
Stop, please stop.

36:05.070 --> 36:06.280
Would you marry me

36:06.960 --> 36:08.560
and fulfill our engagement?

36:10.330 --> 36:13.130
I, Chu Guihong, swear by the name
of the Qianyu Army

36:13.510 --> 36:15.710
to protect you for the rest of your life.

36:20.360 --> 36:21.150
I...

36:21.800 --> 36:23.050
Chu Guihong, I...

36:23.230 --> 36:24.150
I object!

36:29.110 --> 36:32.020
My marriage is not for
others to object to.

36:32.510 --> 36:33.710
Chu Guihong, we—

36:33.710 --> 36:35.770
What if I object?

36:46.400 --> 36:49.040
The latest update on "Exceptional Love"!

36:49.150 --> 36:51.590
An emotional crisis in "Illusory Dream,"

36:51.590 --> 36:54.360
with Chu Guihong's marriage proposal
creating imminent conflict!

36:54.360 --> 36:56.400
New love or old flame?

36:56.400 --> 36:58.510
Accept or reject?

36:58.510 --> 37:00.440
How will she choose?

37:00.440 --> 37:02.840
All in today's update!

37:02.840 --> 37:03.400
Give me one!

37:03.400 --> 37:04.110
Latest edition or not?

37:04.110 --> 37:05.080
I want to see

37:05.110 --> 37:07.000
how incompetent Nan Heng is,

37:07.110 --> 37:08.780
letting Chu Guihong take the lead.

37:08.780 --> 37:09.360
Great, great.

37:09.360 --> 37:10.360
Give me ten copies!

37:10.360 --> 37:11.400
I support Chu Guihong!

37:11.400 --> 37:12.960
I'll pay to support him, okay?

37:12.960 --> 37:13.590
Nice!

37:14.040 --> 37:14.670
One at a time!

37:14.670 --> 37:16.000
Ten copies, here you go!

37:16.360 --> 37:17.480
Mother, why'd you

37:17.480 --> 37:18.960
come unannounced?

37:19.840 --> 37:21.880
If I hadn't come,
what would you have done?

37:21.880 --> 37:23.230
Just wait patiently.

37:23.440 --> 37:26.470
Today, I won't disappoint you.

37:26.670 --> 37:28.860
The Noble Consort has a decree:

37:29.150 --> 37:32.750
The eldest daughter of the Songs,
descendant of a noble house in the capital,

37:32.750 --> 37:36.320
is intelligent and accomplished in music,
calligraphy, and painting.

37:36.320 --> 37:37.760
The Seventh Prince Nan Heng,

37:37.760 --> 37:40.110
young and unmarried,

37:40.110 --> 37:42.880
is of gentle nature and well accomplished.

37:42.960 --> 37:46.760
The two families shall unite
in matrimonial bliss.

37:49.590 --> 37:51.230
So all these betrothal gifts

37:51.670 --> 37:53.110
are for me.

37:53.230 --> 37:54.670
This is too much!

37:55.140 --> 37:56.180
Fine, Heng.

37:57.100 --> 37:58.540
I finally understand.

37:58.560 --> 37:59.550
Everything today

37:59.550 --> 38:02.010
was all planned by you
in advance, wasn't it?

38:02.190 --> 38:03.760
Creating buzz with "Exceptional Love,"

38:03.760 --> 38:05.150
then the seduction at the musical banquet.

38:05.150 --> 38:06.630
And now just as Guihong proposes marriage,

38:06.630 --> 38:08.030
you pull something like this!

38:08.030 --> 38:09.320
You sly fox.

38:09.510 --> 38:10.320
Rui,

38:10.400 --> 38:12.800
how can you slander
your brother like this?

38:13.130 --> 38:14.360
Am I wrong?

38:15.290 --> 38:16.400
Since childhood,

38:16.430 --> 38:18.930
he's always been the most calculating.

38:21.160 --> 38:22.260
Back then,

38:23.040 --> 38:24.710
who knows what methods he used

38:24.710 --> 38:26.440
to harm my mother, the Empress.

38:29.000 --> 38:31.000
Now you're even occupying her position!

38:31.000 --> 38:32.110
You're all thieves,

38:32.110 --> 38:32.510
nothing but robbers—

38:32.510 --> 38:33.150
Nan Rui!

38:34.070 --> 38:35.600
I'll say this one last time.

38:36.190 --> 38:37.550
The former Empress's death had

38:37.550 --> 38:39.480
nothing to do with me nor my mother.

38:40.200 --> 38:42.400
If you dare disrespect my mother again,

38:42.890 --> 38:44.720
I won't hold back.

38:45.190 --> 38:46.500
And what if I do?

38:46.670 --> 38:47.840
Your family only knows how to use

38:47.840 --> 38:49.320
disgraceful, dirty tactics!

38:49.320 --> 38:50.230
Your uncle is like that,

38:50.230 --> 38:51.190
and so is your mother!

38:51.190 --> 38:51.840
You!

38:52.190 --> 38:53.070
Heng!

38:53.880 --> 38:54.680
Your Majesty!

38:55.400 --> 38:56.620
Seventh Prince...

39:03.510 --> 39:05.190
Wait, the plot has changed.

39:05.210 --> 39:06.280
Nan Heng shouldn't be here

39:06.280 --> 39:07.940
having a falling out with Chu Guihong.

39:07.940 --> 39:09.070
What's going on?

39:20.590 --> 39:21.920
-Your Highness!
-Stop!

39:24.230 --> 39:25.480
His Majesty orders

39:25.480 --> 39:28.410
the Seventh Prince and Miss Song
to enter the palace.

39:30.230 --> 39:30.920
I...

39:47.030 --> 39:48.120
Eunuch Liu,

39:48.180 --> 39:49.760
the princes were fighting.

39:49.800 --> 39:51.150
Why am I arrested?

39:51.360 --> 39:52.320
Miss Song,

39:52.320 --> 39:53.840
His Majesty has given his royal word

39:53.840 --> 39:55.230
that he must see you in person.

39:55.230 --> 39:56.360
Please come with me.

39:57.480 --> 39:58.880
My Lady! My Lady!

39:58.880 --> 40:00.070
Gently, gently.

40:00.070 --> 40:01.070
Be gentle.

40:01.840 --> 40:02.760
Oh no.

40:03.270 --> 40:04.770
What should we do now?

40:05.320 --> 40:06.580
Why are you panicking?

40:07.320 --> 40:08.720
Greetings, Second Miss.

40:09.800 --> 40:12.510
My father should be hosting
guests at Juxian Tower.

40:12.510 --> 40:13.840
Come find him with me

40:13.860 --> 40:15.660
to ask him to go to the palace now.

40:15.710 --> 40:16.360
Yiting,

40:16.760 --> 40:18.670
is this matter really that serious?

40:18.670 --> 40:21.400
The two princes just drew weapons
against each other.

40:21.400 --> 40:22.190
Such actions

40:22.360 --> 40:24.590
will surely provoke His Majesty's wrath,

40:24.590 --> 40:26.990
and someone must bear the Emperor's anger.

40:29.210 --> 40:30.090
Song Yimeng,

40:30.820 --> 40:32.280
the situation looks grim.

40:43.620 --> 40:46.850
[Imperial Study]

41:06.840 --> 41:08.730
How long do we have to kneel here?

41:28.120 --> 41:28.980
Pad your knees.

41:32.140 --> 41:33.950
Drop the act.

41:34.110 --> 41:36.040
Stop scheming against me already.

41:36.740 --> 41:38.460
Who schemed against you?

41:38.490 --> 41:40.130
The arranged marriage
was my mother's idea.

41:40.130 --> 41:41.790
What does it have to do with me?

41:42.710 --> 41:43.630
Yes, yes, yes,

41:44.280 --> 41:47.580
You're the kindest person in the world.

41:47.600 --> 41:49.600
How could you possibly be involved?

41:49.670 --> 41:51.320
Can you stop being so

41:51.320 --> 41:52.030
sarcastic?

41:56.320 --> 41:59.030
This was clearly a fight
between the three of you.

41:59.030 --> 42:00.700
Why do the Eighteenth Prince

42:01.360 --> 42:02.990
and Chu Guihong get away with it?

42:02.990 --> 42:04.330
I didn't do anything,

42:04.350 --> 42:05.880
yet I have to keep kneeling here.

42:05.880 --> 42:07.440
Who did I offend?

42:07.990 --> 42:10.320
Can the royals just do
whatever they want?

42:10.480 --> 42:11.550
His Majesty didn't even
get the facts straight.

42:11.550 --> 42:12.440
Miss Song.

42:13.440 --> 42:18.140
[Imperial Study]

42:14.960 --> 42:17.920
His Majesty summons you
to the Imperial Study.

42:19.480 --> 42:20.480
Sure, sure.

42:20.540 --> 42:21.730
As long...

42:23.390 --> 42:25.190
As long as I don't have to kneel anymore,

42:25.190 --> 42:27.030
I'll do anything.

42:27.190 --> 42:28.800
My legs are numb!

42:29.420 --> 42:30.190
I...

42:30.400 --> 42:31.920
Watch your words inside.

42:34.660 --> 42:35.780
I know!
